What does this program print? Write the lines separated by single spaces.

```sql
CREATE TABLE stall (name TEXT, city TEXT, rating INTEGER);
INSERT INTO stall VALUES
  ('Mama Put', 'Ibadan', 4),
  ('Taco Lindo', 'Puebla', 5),
  ('Pho Hoa', 'Hue', 3),
  ('Chai Point', 'Pune', 5);
SELECT name FROM stall WHERE rating >= 4 ORDER BY rating DESC, name LIMIT 2;
```

What does this program print in SQLite? Write the lines separated by single spaces.

```sql
CREATE TABLE t (word TEXT);
INSERT INTO t VALUES ('tea'), ('coffee');
SELECT 'word' FROM t;
SELECT word || '!' FROM t WHERE word = 'tea';
```
